WEBVTT

00:20.520 --> 00:22.981
Hey. You didn't tighten this one.

00:23.523 --> 00:24.899
Okay. Sorry.

00:24.983 --> 00:27.193
Jeez! And the jack stand's
in the wrong place.

00:29.070 --> 00:29.988
It could fall over.

00:31.448 --> 00:32.699
I also told you two days ago.

00:33.867 --> 00:35.702
You're completely hopeless.

00:36.286 --> 00:37.120
Sorry.

00:37.912 --> 00:38.997
SUMIRE
SERVING POPULAR DISHES AND FUGU

00:39.080 --> 00:42.876
Darn that Kato.
He never stops treating me like a newbie.

00:44.377 --> 00:49.549
But I won't be like my dad who worked
seven days a week, then got sick and died.

00:51.301 --> 00:53.386
I may be working this lame job now,

00:53.470 --> 00:56.765
but when I save up some money,
I'll go and learn English.

00:56.848 --> 00:59.851
- Then I'll pursue bigger dreams.
- Didn't know it was so lame.

01:03.104 --> 01:05.523
I'm going to work there for a long time.

01:06.524 --> 01:07.817
I'm sorry that you don't like it.

01:08.735 --> 01:10.070
Oh, sorry.

01:10.153 --> 01:13.073
That attitude of yours
is why Kato always gets mad at you.

01:14.741 --> 01:17.077
How can you talk like that
if you can't even tighten a screw?

01:17.869 --> 01:19.788
This may be boring work,

01:20.455 --> 01:24.125
but I work hard at it every day, get paid,

01:24.709 --> 01:26.544
and my family appreciates me for it.

01:28.254 --> 01:30.465
Has anyone ever appreciated
what you've done?

01:38.556 --> 01:39.766
Hurry it up!

01:39.849 --> 01:40.809
Get out of the way!

01:40.892 --> 01:42.018
Yes, sir.

01:42.101 --> 01:44.395
I'm going to remove the skid plate,
so take out the jack.

01:45.271 --> 01:47.190
Okay. Excuse me.

02:06.084 --> 02:07.919
- Hey!
- You okay?

02:08.002 --> 02:09.129
Out of the way!

02:09.212 --> 02:10.463
- Oh, shit!
- Lift the car!

02:15.593 --> 02:16.427
It's off him!

02:17.011 --> 02:18.138
Come on! You okay?

02:18.221 --> 02:20.014
Hang in there! Take him out slowly!

02:24.060 --> 02:25.645
You okay?

02:26.604 --> 02:28.273
Call an ambulance! Now!

02:28.857 --> 02:30.066
Got it! Will do!

02:30.150 --> 02:31.568
Mr. Kato!

02:31.651 --> 02:32.819
Mr. Kato! Hang in there!

02:32.902 --> 02:34.195
The jack stand slipped!

02:34.946 --> 02:37.490
Kato!

02:38.700 --> 02:40.451
Kato is quitting.

02:42.036 --> 02:42.871
What?

02:43.997 --> 02:46.082
He can't use his hand anymore.

02:48.918 --> 02:49.752
That's all.

02:52.463 --> 02:55.091
I said that's all! Get out.

03:00.388 --> 03:02.724
- Okay. I'll do it.
- Thank you.

03:03.308 --> 03:05.435
- What about that oil change?
- Done already.

03:08.897 --> 03:09.939
That guy…

03:16.696 --> 03:17.822
Come on, focus.

03:20.491 --> 03:22.160
We don't need any more accidents.

03:25.163 --> 03:26.331
Can you hand me a wrench?

03:26.414 --> 03:27.540
- Sure.
- Thank you.

03:27.624 --> 03:29.751
Okay then, I'll check this myself.

05:12.603 --> 05:14.897
Time remaining, nine minutes.

05:14.981 --> 05:17.525
The King of Clubs Team
leads by 500 points.

05:46.846 --> 05:47.972
You asshole!

05:48.556 --> 05:49.724
What the fuck are you doing?

05:49.807 --> 05:53.394
I'm trying to enjoy the last minutes
of this fucked-up game!

05:53.978 --> 05:55.188
You son of a bitch!

05:57.523 --> 05:59.275
You act so goddamn righteous.

05:59.984 --> 06:01.444
You and I are the same!

06:02.070 --> 06:05.073
But I fucking hate
how you're so full of stupid hope!

06:05.656 --> 06:08.701
If I can watch you die
while tasting utter despair,

06:08.785 --> 06:11.370
then I'll be glad to die here with you.

06:28.054 --> 06:29.639
Just eight more minutes.

06:31.140 --> 06:33.392
No sign of the enemy, huh?

06:35.019 --> 06:36.354
I guess it's over.

06:38.898 --> 06:40.358
What a letdown.

06:40.441 --> 06:44.237
It only makes sense.
Whatever they try, they're out of time.

06:46.781 --> 06:48.741
Maybe I'll go take a walk.

07:11.097 --> 07:12.723
I never knew it could take so long…

07:13.891 --> 07:15.852
to wait for death.

07:34.120 --> 07:35.121
Arisu…

07:35.830 --> 07:36.956
I'm sorry…

07:37.540 --> 07:38.666
I couldn't fight…

07:40.001 --> 07:41.878
alongside you till the end.

07:42.462 --> 07:43.296
Usagi,

07:44.172 --> 07:45.840
I should be the one apologizing.

07:46.966 --> 07:47.884
I'm sorry.

08:07.862 --> 08:08.946
Even now…

08:10.198 --> 08:12.325
I'd hate that world if I went back.

08:12.408 --> 08:15.703
But if you stay here, you'll never…

08:17.330 --> 08:20.166
You can't just
randomly lead people around.

08:21.209 --> 08:25.129
You need to listen to their feelings
and wait for them to come around.

08:28.382 --> 08:30.426
Time remaining, seven minutes.

08:55.326 --> 08:56.494
I knew you'd come.

08:59.497 --> 09:03.501
I figured I might meet you if I came here.

09:07.964 --> 09:09.715
I was thinking the same thing.

09:12.260 --> 09:13.261
If I were you, Kyuma,

09:14.595 --> 09:17.014
I'd probably come here to wait for me.

09:20.768 --> 09:22.603
The ocean sure is large.

09:24.355 --> 09:25.856
At the end of life,

09:26.732 --> 09:28.651
we humans want to see something big.

09:39.912 --> 09:41.831
You've defeated us.

09:47.169 --> 09:48.879
You sure you have no regrets?

09:51.716 --> 09:52.800
You know…

09:54.844 --> 09:56.887
I'm a little bit disappointed.

09:59.015 --> 10:01.017
Time remaining, five minutes.

10:04.270 --> 10:05.521
Say, Kyuma.

10:10.234 --> 10:11.861
Before I die, tell me…

10:14.071 --> 10:14.989
the answer.

10:16.407 --> 10:17.700
I can't do that.

10:19.535 --> 10:21.037
I mean, you've given up.

10:24.999 --> 10:26.083
I guess you're right.

10:33.299 --> 10:34.300
Then…

10:36.719 --> 10:37.762
at least,

10:39.639 --> 10:40.681
before I die,

10:42.433 --> 10:43.768
as the last thing I do,

10:45.394 --> 10:47.063
can we shake hands?

10:48.314 --> 10:49.231
Shake hands?

10:50.191 --> 10:51.859
The game hasn't ended yet, you know.

10:52.735 --> 10:54.028
If you touch me now,

10:55.071 --> 10:56.530
we'll battle and I'll win.

11:02.995 --> 11:04.955
From what you told me earlier…

11:08.459 --> 11:09.502
I finally understand.

11:12.421 --> 11:13.506
I should have listened…

11:16.092 --> 11:18.010
to my teammates' feelings more

11:19.887 --> 11:21.764
and waited for them to come around.

11:24.975 --> 11:26.268
Then maybe,

11:27.311 --> 11:29.313
we would have understood
each other better.

11:36.570 --> 11:37.822
Though we're enemies…

11:41.700 --> 11:42.952
Though we're adversaries…

11:46.580 --> 11:49.166
I know it's crazy for me to feel this way,

11:54.463 --> 11:56.215
but I appreciate what you've done.

11:59.301 --> 12:01.429
You helped me realize
something very important.

12:07.726 --> 12:12.148
There's no more time for me
to do anything about it though.

12:15.651 --> 12:16.861
So at least,

12:19.071 --> 12:20.197
before I die…

12:23.451 --> 12:25.077
Since you made me realize it…

12:27.746 --> 12:29.081
I'd like to shake hands with you.

12:44.472 --> 12:45.347
Okay.

12:46.724 --> 12:48.642
Since it's my rival's final request,

12:50.102 --> 12:51.604
I will gladly do it.

12:54.773 --> 12:57.443
Thank you, Kyuma.

12:59.403 --> 13:00.404
Arisu.

13:02.031 --> 13:05.951
I enjoyed competing against you.

13:18.547 --> 13:22.009
There has been a change
in points for both teams.

13:32.520 --> 13:33.604
Seriously?

13:35.606 --> 13:38.150
The Player Team leads by 500 points.

13:38.234 --> 13:41.445
KYUMA: 14,000 LOSE
ARISU & TATTA: 14,950 WIN

13:41.529 --> 13:43.989
KYUMA: 13,500
ARISU & TATTA: 15,450

13:45.950 --> 13:46.909
How did that happen?

13:48.577 --> 13:50.454
You have 14,950 points?

13:52.248 --> 13:53.541
What kind of trick is this?

13:55.000 --> 13:56.460
It's no trick.

14:04.677 --> 14:06.679
Time remaining, seven minutes.

14:45.551 --> 14:47.803
What are you doing? Stop it!

14:47.887 --> 14:49.555
I'm going to take off this bracelet!

14:49.638 --> 14:50.723
Stop it!

14:55.477 --> 14:56.562
Dammit.

14:57.646 --> 14:58.898
I can't get it off.

15:01.233 --> 15:02.276
I can't do it.

15:04.570 --> 15:05.571
Arisu…

15:07.323 --> 15:08.240
Do it for me.

15:10.159 --> 15:11.493
Are you insane?

15:12.453 --> 15:15.039
I came up with a good idea.

15:15.789 --> 15:17.541
There are 10,100 points on this.

15:18.500 --> 15:22.338
If you secretly carry this,
you'll have the power of two.

15:23.547 --> 15:25.424
This way, we can pull ahead of them.

15:27.134 --> 15:28.302
I can't do that.

15:29.261 --> 15:31.722
There's no rule
against removing the bracelets.

15:36.310 --> 15:37.311
Please!

15:39.730 --> 15:41.190
I could never do that!

15:42.441 --> 15:43.651
There's no time!

15:44.485 --> 15:45.486
Please!

15:56.538 --> 15:57.957
This will bring us victory.

16:00.709 --> 16:02.753
Our lives are on the line, you know?

16:03.253 --> 16:04.254
Our lives depend on this!

16:05.005 --> 16:07.341
Time remaining, six minutes.

16:08.258 --> 16:09.385
We'll all die!

16:12.221 --> 16:13.263
Arisu…

16:14.431 --> 16:15.349
Do it!

16:18.060 --> 16:19.770
There's no other way!

16:19.853 --> 16:20.771
Hurry!

16:21.689 --> 16:22.606
I can't…

16:23.691 --> 16:25.484
Do you want to kill us all?

16:25.567 --> 16:26.485
Do it!

16:28.237 --> 16:29.321
Do it now!

16:30.531 --> 16:31.532
Do it!

16:34.076 --> 16:35.160
Arisu!

16:37.371 --> 16:38.706
Do it!

17:11.030 --> 17:11.989
Tatta!

17:12.072 --> 17:12.906
I'm sorry!

17:13.490 --> 17:14.366
I'm sorry!

17:16.493 --> 17:18.078
I'm sorry…

17:19.079 --> 17:20.080
I made you do this.

17:27.379 --> 17:28.630
Take this.

17:28.714 --> 17:30.883
- I've got to stop the bleeding!
- Forget it! Go!

17:42.811 --> 17:43.645
Arisu…

17:45.481 --> 17:47.649
Remember how you said
"Thank you" to me earlier?

17:49.651 --> 17:51.236
That made me really happy.

17:53.947 --> 17:57.326
Let me be the guy
who does something cool for once.

18:00.454 --> 18:01.455
I'll be fine.

18:02.122 --> 18:03.957
I won't die from just this.

18:06.168 --> 18:08.212
Hurry or we'll all die!

18:08.295 --> 18:09.129
Go!

18:12.716 --> 18:13.717
Go!

18:14.593 --> 18:15.427
Go!

18:38.534 --> 18:40.661
Holy shit…

18:42.663 --> 18:45.666
You're way more fucked up than I am.

18:48.627 --> 18:50.254
This was thanks to my teammate.

18:54.716 --> 18:58.137
Looks like we're the losers.

19:02.724 --> 19:04.184
But even you

19:06.145 --> 19:07.563
must be afraid of dying.

19:09.189 --> 19:10.357
No.

19:11.817 --> 19:14.444
But I made a promise
to Shitara who died earlier.

19:18.657 --> 19:20.868
He said he'd beat the shit
out of me if we lost.

19:22.494 --> 19:25.414
I don't like the idea
of getting beat up in heaven.

19:27.541 --> 19:30.127
And everyone
who trusted me will be angry too.

19:34.965 --> 19:36.300
I'm sorry.

19:41.096 --> 19:42.598
It was just like you said.

19:44.183 --> 19:49.396
In this game,
both our teams battled each other

19:50.814 --> 19:53.317
with all our might and all our souls.

19:56.486 --> 19:57.779
And I learned something.

20:00.324 --> 20:01.325
Kyuma…

20:03.243 --> 20:05.787
You guys were once players too,
weren't you?

20:11.543 --> 20:12.961
Damn that Kyuma.

20:14.838 --> 20:17.007
He let his guard down at the end.

20:19.927 --> 20:22.012
You're the one to talk.

20:24.264 --> 20:25.182
You're right.

20:26.892 --> 20:31.647
We only survived this long
thanks to Kyuma.

20:33.357 --> 20:35.567
So I won't criticize him for failing.

20:37.194 --> 20:38.028
For sure.

20:40.030 --> 20:41.698
Thank you, Kyuma.

20:43.367 --> 20:44.534
It was fun!

20:47.246 --> 20:49.373
Let's do crazy shit on the other side too!

21:00.467 --> 21:01.635
Kyuma…

21:02.344 --> 21:06.181
Your feelings for your teammates
are the same as ours.

21:08.267 --> 21:11.270
They came from surviving deathmatches
over and over again…

21:12.813 --> 21:13.897
together.

21:15.857 --> 21:17.025
Just like us,

21:18.610 --> 21:23.282
you guys were players
who won game after game.

21:26.743 --> 21:27.828
Isn't that right?

21:33.750 --> 21:35.585
But even after clearing all the games,

21:36.670 --> 21:41.174
you couldn't return and could only
become citizens of this land, right?

21:44.886 --> 21:45.762
Please…

21:48.515 --> 21:49.766
Tell me!

21:56.815 --> 21:58.650
If that's how it seems to you,

22:00.235 --> 22:01.987
then that must be the truth.

22:08.410 --> 22:10.162
You call that an answer?

22:14.750 --> 22:16.001
If that's the truth…

22:25.302 --> 22:26.136
then…

22:28.138 --> 22:30.140
there's no point in continuing to play.

22:31.767 --> 22:33.935
So, you'll quit playing the games?

22:38.774 --> 22:40.358
Why are we doing this?

22:47.115 --> 22:48.325
I can't do it.

22:52.120 --> 22:54.122
I can't become tough like you.

22:56.083 --> 23:00.128
You'll never be like me,
and there's no need to be like me.

23:02.172 --> 23:03.715
The choice

23:05.092 --> 23:06.593
is always yours alone.

23:11.181 --> 23:13.058
Time has run out.

23:13.725 --> 23:16.228
Since the King of Clubs Team
has fewer points,

23:16.311 --> 23:19.397
the game is over
for all their team members.

23:19.898 --> 23:20.816
Arisu…

23:23.026 --> 23:24.236
Well done.

23:32.911 --> 23:34.496
I don't want you to die!

23:37.999 --> 23:42.254
Once we meet here, one of us has to die.
Those are the rules.

23:43.797 --> 23:45.966
If we hadn't met in this game, we could…

23:46.049 --> 23:48.260
It's exactly because we met in this game,

23:49.386 --> 23:51.304
that we came to understand one another.

23:54.391 --> 23:56.143
If we'd met somewhere else,

23:59.271 --> 24:01.273
we could have become friends.

24:05.402 --> 24:07.279
Aren't we already friends?

24:10.657 --> 24:11.783
Arisu.

24:13.451 --> 24:15.036
I hope you find it soon.

24:17.330 --> 24:21.251
I hope you find
your own true reason for living…

24:22.752 --> 24:24.462
not just someone else's.

24:35.891 --> 24:37.601
I pray for that from my heart.

24:52.949 --> 24:54.284
So, this is death.

24:56.244 --> 24:58.163
It's actually not so bad.

25:02.667 --> 25:04.753
I don't have a single regret.

25:09.507 --> 25:11.843
It's been the ideal life.

25:55.762 --> 25:57.097
Kyuma…

25:59.307 --> 26:01.851
The Player Team has cleared the game.

26:52.819 --> 26:53.653
Usagi?

27:01.202 --> 27:02.412
Kuina…

27:02.954 --> 27:04.205
We won.

27:05.415 --> 27:06.249
What?

27:07.208 --> 27:08.043
Really?

27:11.838 --> 27:13.089
PLAYER TEAM
CONGRATULATIONS

27:13.173 --> 27:15.300
Arisu must have pulled something off.

27:19.304 --> 27:20.180
We won?

27:30.190 --> 27:31.316
Tatta, are you okay?

27:31.816 --> 27:32.817
Tatta!

27:33.318 --> 27:34.444
Wake up!

27:40.116 --> 27:41.159
Hang in there!

27:44.204 --> 27:45.038
Tatta!

27:49.542 --> 27:50.460
Tatta…

27:53.338 --> 27:54.172
Tatta.

27:55.048 --> 27:56.216
We won.

27:57.425 --> 27:58.843
We won the game!

27:59.677 --> 28:00.929
It's thanks to you!

28:02.597 --> 28:03.973
All right.

28:07.352 --> 28:09.479
Come on, stay with us!

28:10.063 --> 28:11.314
Hang in there!

28:12.190 --> 28:13.066
Tatta!

28:15.652 --> 28:16.528
What do you think?

28:18.822 --> 28:19.906
Even I…

28:21.032 --> 28:24.119
can do a good job when I try.

28:25.995 --> 28:27.831
Yeah! You did well!

28:28.748 --> 28:30.333
It's all thanks to you, Tatta!

28:33.420 --> 28:34.337
Thank you.

28:42.720 --> 28:44.347
Hey, Tatta.

28:45.473 --> 28:47.517
Tatta! Don't go!

28:48.852 --> 28:49.936
Don't!

28:50.520 --> 28:51.438
Tatta!

28:52.439 --> 28:53.523
Tatta!

28:53.606 --> 28:56.192
You've got to be kidding.
Stay with us, Tatta!

28:56.818 --> 28:57.944
Tatta!

28:59.112 --> 29:00.488
Don't go!

29:01.072 --> 29:02.282
Tatta!

29:03.283 --> 29:04.534
Tatta!

29:07.537 --> 29:08.538
Tatta…

29:09.622 --> 29:10.957
Don't go…

29:48.286 --> 29:49.621
It's a beautiful view.

29:52.123 --> 29:53.750
It's not so bad right here.

29:54.751 --> 29:55.668
Yeah.

30:08.348 --> 30:09.182
I can't.

30:11.476 --> 30:13.311
I can't let this go to waste.

30:17.482 --> 30:21.653
We need to keep on going for Tatta's sake.

30:38.878 --> 30:41.005
When I think about
how it was you who saved me,

30:42.090 --> 30:43.508
it makes me sick.

30:46.511 --> 30:47.345
But you know…

30:49.472 --> 30:51.641
since I'm still alive, I can't complain.

30:58.398 --> 30:59.649
Thanks, man.

31:30.013 --> 31:35.059
TEIO PRISON

32:10.720 --> 32:17.727
PUT ON A COLLAR AND GO UPSTAIRS
TO THE CENTRAL GUARDROOM.

33:23.751 --> 33:25.795
Difficulty, Jack of Hearts.

33:28.172 --> 33:29.924
Game, Prison Cell.

33:31.509 --> 33:36.347
Rules. Guess the suit that appears
on the back of your collar.

33:36.431 --> 33:40.268
However, you cannot see your own suit.

33:42.729 --> 33:43.813
I can't see it.

33:45.606 --> 33:47.734
The time limit per round is one hour.

33:48.234 --> 33:49.944
Five minutes before the time is up,

33:50.028 --> 33:53.948
enter one of the prison cells
and guess what your own suit is.

34:11.716 --> 34:15.595
If you do not guess your suit correctly,
the game is over for you.

34:15.678 --> 34:21.142
When time runs out,
your collar will explode and you will die.

34:21.726 --> 34:25.438
In addition,
your suit will change at every round.

34:27.440 --> 34:31.611
But we just need to have
someone tell us what it is, right?

34:32.361 --> 34:33.237
That'll be easy.

34:33.738 --> 34:34.864
I wouldn't be so sure.

34:35.531 --> 34:37.742
They haven't told us
how to clear the game.

34:38.493 --> 34:43.498
Prison Cell is a test of
how much you can trust others.

34:43.581 --> 34:47.543
In addition, the Jack of Hearts
has secretly joined the game

34:47.627 --> 34:50.338
as one of the participants.

34:51.672 --> 34:52.757
See? There it is.

34:55.426 --> 34:59.305
One of us is the Jack of Hearts.

35:01.307 --> 35:02.475
Clear condition.

35:03.059 --> 35:05.311
Every hour, this will be repeated.

35:05.394 --> 35:07.063
The game is cleared

35:07.146 --> 35:11.359
when the Jack of Hearts,
who is hiding among you, is killed.

35:14.028 --> 35:15.196
Prohibited activities.

35:15.696 --> 35:18.991
Using reflective objects to see your suit.

35:20.284 --> 35:24.372
You also may not use violence
or weapons to kill others.

35:25.706 --> 35:26.707
In other words,

35:27.291 --> 35:30.128
until the Jack fails
to answer correctly and dies,

35:30.795 --> 35:31.963
this game won't end.

35:32.964 --> 35:34.340
Which means,

35:35.091 --> 35:38.761
unless we lie to the Jack,
we can't clear this game.

35:39.554 --> 35:41.764
There is no time limit.

35:42.348 --> 35:43.307
No time limit?

35:43.933 --> 35:46.602
There is plenty of food.

35:48.271 --> 35:49.230
What?

35:58.197 --> 36:00.241
While participating in this game,

36:00.324 --> 36:02.910
the days remaining
on your visas will not be reduced.

36:05.413 --> 36:07.165
Unless we lie like crazy

36:07.248 --> 36:09.876
and eliminate anyone
suspected of being the Jack,

36:10.376 --> 36:12.879
we'll be in this prison forever.

36:15.965 --> 36:17.592
A life sentence, huh?

36:18.676 --> 36:20.678
The game will now start.

36:21.345 --> 36:22.221
ROUND 1

36:22.305 --> 36:26.100
You may pass the time anywhere you like
until it is time to enter a prison cell.

36:34.942 --> 36:35.943
Seriously?

36:41.365 --> 36:42.325
Well…

36:43.743 --> 36:45.995
Will you please tell me?

36:46.495 --> 36:47.914
I'll tell you yours.

36:49.999 --> 36:51.250
In this game,

36:52.001 --> 36:57.089
the 20 of us need to kill each other off
until we get the Jack of Hearts, right?

36:59.133 --> 37:01.719
Are you sure
you want to trust each other so easily?

37:06.224 --> 37:07.350
Let's go downstairs.

37:26.035 --> 37:26.911
I have an idea.

37:26.994 --> 37:30.206
Why don't we form a team
and tell one another?

37:30.289 --> 37:32.875
If we do that, then we can't lie.

37:32.959 --> 37:34.168
I agree.

37:34.252 --> 37:37.004
Can I be on the team?

37:37.088 --> 37:38.005
Me too.

37:38.506 --> 37:40.633
Me too, please.

37:41.467 --> 37:43.761
The more, the merrier.

37:43.844 --> 37:44.845
Can I join too?

37:45.429 --> 37:47.848
- Tell me. What suit am I?
- Okay…

37:48.891 --> 37:49.850
Well…

37:49.934 --> 37:52.270
Speak up, man!

37:52.353 --> 37:55.189
- What am I? Come on.
- But…

37:55.815 --> 37:58.067
Can't you say it? I'll tell you yours too.

37:59.026 --> 38:00.027
Okay.

38:06.742 --> 38:08.828
Hey, let's tell each other.

38:10.454 --> 38:12.248
If you want to survive,

38:12.331 --> 38:15.334
you need to observe
everyone here very closely.

38:16.711 --> 38:19.422
You need to remember everyone
who doesn't lie.

38:21.716 --> 38:24.135
Besides, I could be
the Jack of Hearts myself.

38:26.762 --> 38:27.596
Look.

38:28.139 --> 38:30.141
They've already broken up into groups.

38:31.058 --> 38:34.353
They're all sizing up one another
to see if they can trust anyone.

38:38.399 --> 38:39.442
See those two?

38:44.113 --> 38:47.325
Do you know what they were doing
before the game began?

38:57.793 --> 38:58.711
Really?

39:00.046 --> 39:01.839
That guy's got massive confidence.

39:01.922 --> 39:03.883
He's got her under his thumb

39:04.550 --> 39:08.220
and won't let her get involved
with any other participants.

39:09.388 --> 39:13.559
In this game, if you build
ultimate confidence with one person,

39:14.060 --> 39:15.436
you'll survive and win.

39:15.936 --> 39:16.771
Hey.

39:20.274 --> 39:22.485
It looks like
you still don't have a partner.

39:23.277 --> 39:26.197
Tell me my suit, and I'll tell you yours.

39:30.951 --> 39:33.120
That's a pretty damn
authoritative way of speaking.

39:33.954 --> 39:34.789
What?

39:35.790 --> 39:38.793
I can tell a lot
from your childish attitude.

39:40.544 --> 39:44.256
You're ashamed of your own dark side
and are jealous of everyone.

39:44.882 --> 39:47.385
Behind those bangs
is where you keep your real self.

39:48.469 --> 39:51.639
You hide your face to keep people
from seeing your disgusting true nature.

39:53.557 --> 39:54.850
You're the type

39:54.934 --> 39:57.645
who makes yourself feel better
by looking down on others.

40:02.733 --> 40:05.820
But that's what I like about you.

40:14.036 --> 40:15.371
Let's be friends.

40:27.675 --> 40:30.845
Say, would you like to join our team?

40:32.513 --> 40:33.764
It's okay if you don't want to.

40:34.849 --> 40:35.975
No, I don't mind…

40:37.101 --> 40:39.770
Okay. Let's work together.

40:42.106 --> 40:43.607
- Do you want to join us?
- Yeah.

40:44.150 --> 40:46.068
I'll be in your care.

40:48.112 --> 40:49.530
First, we'll start with me.

40:50.114 --> 40:52.658
Tell me what suit I am, everybody.

40:53.534 --> 40:56.871
Urumi, your suit is heart.

40:56.954 --> 40:59.039
- Yes, heart.
- It's heart.

41:01.041 --> 41:04.295
Okay, now for me, please.

41:04.378 --> 41:05.504
You're a heart too.

41:05.588 --> 41:07.089
- It's heart.
- Heart.

41:08.966 --> 41:10.217
I'll go next.

41:12.720 --> 41:14.847
- It's spade.
- Yes, it's spade.

41:14.930 --> 41:16.098
- It's spade.
- Spade.

41:16.182 --> 41:18.142
- Can I go next?
- Okay.

41:18.726 --> 41:21.312
- Diamond.
- It's diamond.

41:21.395 --> 41:22.605
My turn next.

41:23.189 --> 41:24.899
- It's diamond.
- Thank you.

41:24.982 --> 41:27.318
- It's diamond.
- Okay. Mine, please.

41:27.401 --> 41:29.612
- It's spade.
- It's club.

41:29.695 --> 41:31.363
Thank you.

41:31.447 --> 41:33.407
Oh, and me, please?

41:34.533 --> 41:36.452
It is time to make your guess.

41:37.036 --> 41:41.415
Everyone, please enter a prison cell.
One person per cell, please.

41:58.265 --> 42:00.518
Please make your guess.

42:02.019 --> 42:03.020
Diamond.

42:28.754 --> 42:33.092
Well, well. That was easy.

42:40.182 --> 42:41.392
Thank goodness.

42:41.475 --> 42:42.893
Let's work together again.

42:44.270 --> 42:46.438
Thanks goodness. I'm so happy.

42:49.400 --> 42:51.527
Round 2 will now start.

42:57.241 --> 43:00.995
- Thank you very much, everyone.
- Not at all. Thank you as well.

43:01.078 --> 43:03.998
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

43:05.291 --> 43:07.293
- Let's do it again.
- Yes, let's.

43:07.376 --> 43:09.795
- Please.
- Likewise.

43:10.379 --> 43:13.424
You know,
I wonder how long this will last.

43:15.050 --> 43:17.303
Either the Jack will start killing people,

43:17.845 --> 43:20.681
or someone who's afraid they'll be killed
will start killing others.

43:21.974 --> 43:26.145
Until one of those things happens,
this will never end.

43:26.228 --> 43:27.855
That's exactly right.

43:30.441 --> 43:33.068
As long as we're all telling each other,
we'll be fine.

43:34.528 --> 43:35.696
I wouldn't be so sure.

43:36.238 --> 43:37.531
What's your goddamn problem?

43:40.534 --> 43:42.244
Hurry up and tell me, fucker!

43:48.334 --> 43:49.501
You okay?

43:53.005 --> 43:54.173
Tell him "club."

44:04.058 --> 44:05.976
You want another knuckle sandwich?

44:15.235 --> 44:17.237
Now tell me!

44:17.988 --> 44:18.989
Club…

44:19.073 --> 44:20.032
What?

44:20.532 --> 44:21.659
Club!

44:30.834 --> 44:32.252
Tell me faster next time.

44:48.477 --> 44:50.688
Now the game is starting for real.

45:08.038 --> 45:09.248
Are you all right?

45:10.916 --> 45:11.792
Yeah.

45:12.584 --> 45:15.379
Why don't you join our group too?

45:18.424 --> 45:19.341
Thank you.

45:31.478 --> 45:32.312
ROUND 2

45:32.396 --> 45:34.022
It is time to make your guess.

45:34.731 --> 45:38.986
Everyone, please enter a prison cell.
One person per cell, please.

46:00.048 --> 46:02.301
Please make your guess.

46:04.011 --> 46:05.387
Club.

46:18.150 --> 46:19.234
GENKI KIRIU

46:28.827 --> 46:30.078
Hey, what do we do now?

46:32.080 --> 46:32.915
He's dead.

46:33.957 --> 46:34.875
That guy, huh?

46:36.126 --> 46:37.544
He really died…

46:38.170 --> 46:41.590
That person, right? That was him, no?

46:51.141 --> 46:52.059
Say…

46:54.228 --> 46:56.230
He's probably the Jack.

46:58.774 --> 47:01.777
He lied and killed that guy.

47:05.822 --> 47:08.825
Let's kill him on this round.

47:10.118 --> 47:10.994
What?

47:13.163 --> 47:14.206
You mean

47:15.457 --> 47:18.252
you want us to lie to him?

47:20.170 --> 47:24.299
I mean, he's clearly the Jack.

47:24.383 --> 47:26.510
Even if he's not, he's dangerous.

47:27.386 --> 47:30.097
Let's kill him now while we can.

47:54.329 --> 47:55.414
So, next…

47:56.039 --> 47:56.873
Your turn.

48:00.961 --> 48:01.837
Heart.

48:02.337 --> 48:03.255
- It is.
- It's heart.

48:03.338 --> 48:04.756
- That's right.
- Thank you.

48:04.840 --> 48:07.175
- Could you do mine next?
- Sure.

48:08.635 --> 48:10.470
Your suit is diamond.

48:11.263 --> 48:12.389
It's diamond.

48:12.472 --> 48:14.057
- It's diamond.
- Diamond.

48:15.142 --> 48:16.518
Do mine, please.

48:18.687 --> 48:21.690
Your suit is spade.

48:23.609 --> 48:25.527
- Spade…
- It's spade…

48:25.611 --> 48:27.779
- It's spade.
- It's spade.

48:27.863 --> 48:29.031
Thank you.

49:00.228 --> 49:02.397
Please make your guess.

49:04.691 --> 49:05.734
Spade.

49:09.655 --> 49:10.739
AKIFUMI SETO

49:14.868 --> 49:16.870
Round 4 will now start.

49:17.996 --> 49:19.831
What? How come?

49:20.832 --> 49:23.001
You mean he wasn't the Jack of Hearts?

49:27.214 --> 49:29.383
You see? Just like I told you.

49:30.676 --> 49:34.137
People are already starting
to lose their sanity.

49:36.139 --> 49:38.975
Even though there is no time limit,

49:40.310 --> 49:42.062
this won't take long to end.

50:16.555 --> 50:17.806
That woman…

50:17.889 --> 50:21.768
When we were planning
to lie to that guy, she was against it.

50:23.270 --> 50:24.521
Why don't we get rid of her?

50:37.492 --> 50:38.577
Mine, please.

50:40.454 --> 50:41.288
Diamond.

50:41.872 --> 50:43.832
- Yes, it's diamond.
- It's diamond.

50:47.043 --> 50:49.629
Okay, mine too, please.

50:53.175 --> 50:56.845
Your suit is club.

50:57.763 --> 50:58.597
Club…

50:59.431 --> 51:00.766
- Club.
- It's club.

51:01.850 --> 51:03.894
- Club. It's club.
- Club.

51:05.937 --> 51:06.938
Thank you.

51:15.238 --> 51:17.324
Please make your guess.

51:21.453 --> 51:22.370
Spade.

51:30.378 --> 51:31.421
MEISA TOKUI

51:35.467 --> 51:37.594
- It's spade.
- Yes, it's spade.

51:37.677 --> 51:39.179
- Spade.
- Thank you.

51:40.806 --> 51:41.973
Mine, please.

51:42.057 --> 51:43.642
It's club.

51:43.725 --> 51:46.144
- Club.
- Yes, it's club.

51:49.773 --> 51:52.609
Your suit is heart.

51:53.360 --> 51:54.319
It's heart.

51:54.820 --> 51:56.154
- Heart.
- Heart.

51:56.238 --> 51:58.240
Now mine, please.

52:03.161 --> 52:04.621
Yours is spade.

52:05.205 --> 52:07.290
- Spade.
- It's spade.

52:07.791 --> 52:09.084
Thank you.

52:14.172 --> 52:15.006
Excuse me.

52:16.299 --> 52:17.259
Sorry.

52:18.468 --> 52:19.302
Sorry.

52:21.972 --> 52:25.767
If it's possible,
could you tell me my suit?

52:28.562 --> 52:30.313
I can't trust my group anymore.

52:34.317 --> 52:35.235
Sure.

52:36.987 --> 52:38.071
Thank you.

52:39.072 --> 52:40.407
I appreciate this.

52:46.204 --> 52:47.163
It's club.

52:48.582 --> 52:49.416
Club…

52:51.334 --> 52:52.294
Club…

52:54.421 --> 52:55.380
Club.

52:56.882 --> 52:57.841
Thank you.

52:58.466 --> 52:59.759
Thank you.

53:00.260 --> 53:01.136
Club.

53:07.058 --> 53:08.143
Just in case.

53:21.698 --> 53:23.783
Please make your guess.

53:27.871 --> 53:29.122
Club.

53:39.132 --> 53:40.133
SHINOBU FURUTA

53:42.052 --> 53:43.720
Round 6 will now start.

53:49.351 --> 53:51.102
Why are they lying to each other?

53:51.895 --> 53:53.980
Well, it only figures.

53:54.981 --> 53:57.025
Nobody wants to die.

54:21.967 --> 54:23.885
MASASHI OTA, KAKERU KISHOIN

54:26.096 --> 54:28.139
Round 9 will now start.

54:30.016 --> 54:32.519
I can't take this anymore.

54:33.353 --> 54:34.562
I'm going to puke.

54:35.981 --> 54:37.983
Pull yourself together.

54:39.234 --> 54:40.902
Yours is club.

54:40.986 --> 54:42.946
Okay, now tell me mine.

54:45.740 --> 54:46.574
D…

54:49.494 --> 54:50.412
D…

54:52.122 --> 54:53.164
Heart.

54:54.749 --> 54:55.834
Heart.

54:55.917 --> 54:57.210
- It's heart.
- Heart.

55:14.352 --> 55:16.354
Let's get rid of him.

55:16.980 --> 55:18.356
- What?
- What?

55:18.440 --> 55:20.817
For a second there, he tried to lie to me.

55:21.693 --> 55:24.404
I don't think he likes
the way I'm doing things.

55:24.487 --> 55:25.321
But…

55:26.322 --> 55:29.325
Unless we get rid of him soon,
you'll be in danger too.

55:34.039 --> 55:36.041
Round 10 will now start.

55:36.958 --> 55:40.336
Let's get rid of her.

55:43.882 --> 55:45.550
That woman is dangerous.

55:46.676 --> 55:49.763
We can't let that woman

55:50.346 --> 55:52.599
keep doing just as she pleases.

56:08.448 --> 56:10.033
Here you are.

56:10.116 --> 56:13.036
First, here's a drink.

56:14.120 --> 56:15.538
And some crackers.

56:17.040 --> 56:18.625
Your selection sucks.

56:22.170 --> 56:23.505
I don't like them.

56:24.005 --> 56:26.257
- Let's kill…
- I don't like them.

56:26.925 --> 56:28.343
those two.

56:29.803 --> 56:30.678
What?

56:56.704 --> 56:58.456
Spade…

56:59.791 --> 57:01.084
Diamond…

57:02.877 --> 57:03.962
Diamond.

57:04.462 --> 57:05.839
Spade.

57:06.714 --> 57:07.799
Diamond.

57:09.259 --> 57:10.176
Thank you.

57:10.260 --> 57:12.595
You're the only ones I can trust.

57:21.146 --> 57:23.314
Please make your guess.

57:28.236 --> 57:29.320
Diamond.

57:29.404 --> 57:30.363
Spade!

57:40.457 --> 57:41.666
URUMI AKAMAKI

57:41.749 --> 57:42.584
MOTOHIKO KANEKO

57:51.885 --> 57:53.178
Spade.

57:55.180 --> 57:56.181
Club.

58:02.020 --> 58:04.272
SATOMI AOKI

58:05.565 --> 58:08.860
It's going exactly the way
the Jack of Hearts wants it to.

58:10.945 --> 58:13.656
Once the taboo of killing
your own teammates is broken,

58:14.449 --> 58:15.992
the whole group breaks down.

58:18.328 --> 58:20.872
But that won't happen to us.

58:21.456 --> 58:22.290
That's right.

58:23.583 --> 58:25.543
You don't need to worry.

58:26.461 --> 58:28.087
I'll protect you.

58:31.174 --> 58:32.467
Oh, Mr. Yaba…

58:46.606 --> 58:48.316
This game is insane!

58:51.152 --> 58:52.153
Diamond.

58:59.410 --> 59:00.912
How long will this continue?

59:07.794 --> 59:09.337
I can't take it anymore.

59:14.801 --> 59:15.802
I thought…

59:17.512 --> 59:19.472
people were better than this.

59:22.433 --> 59:24.185
You've lived a blessed life.

59:27.272 --> 59:28.314
But you know,

59:29.649 --> 59:33.903
the reality we're faced with
is happening right here and now.

59:35.905 --> 59:40.451
Right now, all you and I can do
is tell each other what our suit is.

59:41.703 --> 59:43.580
That's the only way we'll survive.

59:50.128 --> 59:52.714
Anyway, let's hang in there.

59:58.052 --> 59:59.012
Okay.

01:00:00.805 --> 01:00:01.639
Mine, please.

01:00:11.858 --> 01:00:12.734
Heart.

01:00:31.586 --> 01:00:32.587
I can't do this.

01:00:37.925 --> 01:00:38.843
I…

01:00:40.762 --> 01:00:41.679
can't take this.

01:00:43.264 --> 01:00:45.642
Please make your guess.

01:00:59.113 --> 01:01:00.490
I want out!

01:01:05.995 --> 01:01:06.829
IPPEI OKI

01:01:18.549 --> 01:01:20.510
You were far too kind-hearted,

01:01:21.094 --> 01:01:22.095
Ippei.

01:01:27.100 --> 01:01:28.351
Well…

01:01:29.686 --> 01:01:31.521
I've lost my partner.

01:01:49.831 --> 01:01:51.124
I think I'm in a bind.

01:04:27.071 --> 01:04:32.076
Subtitle translation by: Brian Athey
